              "startLine1based": 982,
              "endLine1based": 1023,
              "text": "def(\n    \"삼각비\",\n    \"02\",\n    \"삼각비를 이용하여 삼각형의 변의 길이 구하기\",\n    SEC.뜻,\n    \"기본\",\n    (rng) =>\n      attempt(120, () => {\n        const [p, q, r] = pick(rng, TRIPLES);\n        const mode = intBetween(rng, 0, 2);\n        const t = intBetween(rng, 1, 4);\n        // $\\angle B=90^\\circ$ · $\\angle A$ 기준: 대변 $pt$, 이웃변 $qt$, 빗변 $rt$.\n        const opp = p * t;\n        const adj = q * t;\n        const hyp = r * t;\n        if (hyp > 80) return null;\n        const [gnum, gden] = red(mode === 1 ? q : p, mode === 2 ? q : r);\n        if (gnum >= gden) return null;\n        const given = mode === 2 ? adj : hyp;\n        const x = mode === 1 ? adj : opp;\n        const givenSide = mode === 2 ? SIDE_NAMES[0]! : SIDE_NAMES[2]!;\n        const askSide = mode === 1 ? SIDE_NAMES[0]! : SIDE_NAMES[1]!;\n        const relation = [\n          `\\\\sin A=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{BC}}{\\\\overline{AC}}`,\n          `\\\\cos A=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{AB}}{\\\\overline{AC}}`,\n          `\\\\tan A=\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{BC}}{\\\\overline{AB}}`,\n        ][mode]!;\n        return {\n          content: `직각삼각형 $ABC$에서 $\\\\angle B=90^\\\\circ$이고 $${trigOf(mode, \"A\")}=${frac(gnum, gden)}$, $${givenSide}=${cm(given)}$일 때, $${askSide}$의 길이를 구하시오.`,\n          answer: `$${cm(x)}$`,\n          solution: `$${relation}$이다.\\n따라서 $${askSide}=${given}\\\\times${frac(gnum, gden)}=${x}\\\\,(\\\\mathrm{cm})$이다.`,\n          facts: { num: gnum, den: gden, given, x, mode },\n          figureSpec: figRight({\n            vert: adj,\n            horz: opp,\n            dims: mode === 2 ? { AB: dimCm(given) } : { CA: dimCm(given) },\n          }),\n        };\n      }),\n  ),\n\n  "
            }
          }
        ],
